# Pairs with ParentSiblingConsistency. Parent routing is published without the child-side reference.
MODULE: LinkOmitsChildParent
TARGET: ParentSiblingConsistency
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the parent routes to a leaf that does not point back to its parent
PERTURBS: Link

--- FIND
    /\ childParent' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: omit the child-side link.
    /\ childParent' = FALSE
--- END
